pqvpn (3.0.0-1) experimental; urgency=medium

  * Fail closed on client IPC: only root and PQVPN_ALLOWED_UIDS may connect.
  * Throttle failed logins and TOTP codes per source IP on the account API.
  * Revoke all sessions and suspend all devices on password change.
  * Depend on systemd-resolved; create the allowed-uids drop-in on install.

